sely to pull yourself towards them. Fight gravity pulling you towards the abyss or spikes! Beating all of the 10 levels placed among Asian floating islands will require a calm mind and a fast hand - do you have what it takes?\n\nSpirit Journey is a non-violent shooting game, offering 10 amazing levels. You can play using a BT controller or the touchpad. Like the game and want more? Be sure to let us know, and we will make updates with new levels!", "short_description": "Embark on a spiritual journey into your own mind! Use your willpower to pull yourself towards lanterns floating in the air, but be quick and precise - otherwise you will fall into the abyss or get impaled on spikes! Get ready to conquer 10 challenging levels and fight merciless gravity!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.facebook.com/spiritjourneyvr/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.facebook.com/spiritjourneyvr/", "publisher_name": "Indago", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.facebook.com/spiritjourneyvr/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["ACTION", "EXPLORATION", "PUZZLE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": [], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "497850938567795"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12602103_710537365762797_1097881728_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=J8ycmFOR6zkQ7kNvwGnW72L&_nc_oc=AdqPA_WvE1g8c0z-kAiMOvmY8pm3VZZcW-KNs1EPg5BHQ2lejoyNohhwjffnO_xRTqc&_nc_zt=